ip lead without unnecessary risk\n\nA continuation bet might work, but given my hand strength is so marginal (any overcard pairs me beat), checking is the safer, more optimal play. I'm ahead in chips overall and don't need to gamble with weak holdings.\n\n**Answer: 0**"}
